    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
      {
        "@value": "TRAN is required in all AGS4 files (Rule 14)\nTRAN_DLIM shall be included if record linking is used. If TRAN_DLIM is not defined, the default shall be a | (pipe symbol).\nTRAN_RCON shall be included if record linking is used. If TRAN_RCON is not defined, the default shall be a + .\nDelimiter and concatenator characters (TRAN_DLIM & TRAN_RCON) need to be defined if Record Link data or multiple concatenated abbreviations are included in the file. These characters cannot be used in IDs and abbreviations that are referred to in data key sets.",
